{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CombatState","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"CombatState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the central data structure that tracks information needed to manage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn-based combat encounters. It maintains the participants, progression, equipment, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any special conditions or modifiers that affect the combat."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Combat-Flow-Integration","text":"Combat Flow Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The combat state is stored in the game’s global state under ","type":"text"},{"code":"GlobalID.combatState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"managed by the ","type":"text"},{"code":"GameEngine","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". When combat begins (either through player-initiated attacks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or enemy encounters), a new ","type":"text"},{"code":"CombatState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is created and stored. The state persists across","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"combat rounds until the encounter ends through victory, defeat, or escape.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Usage-in-Combat-Systems","text":"Usage in Combat Systems"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Combat systems conforming to the "},{"code":"CombatSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol receive the current "},{"code":"CombatState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"code":"ActionContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and use it to make combat decisions. The state can be modified"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between rounds to track progression, change weapons, or apply temporary effects."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"State-Persistence","text":"State Persistence"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" type, ","type":"text"},{"code":"CombatState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be serialized for save games, ensuring that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ongoing combat encounters persist across game sessions.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example-Usage","text":"Example Usage"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Starting combat with a troll using a sword","let combatState = CombatState(","    enemyID: .troll,","    roundCount: 0,","    playerWeaponID: .sword",")"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Represents the current state of an active combat encounter in the interactive fiction engine.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/Se","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/SE","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/SQ","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/SH","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CombatState"}],"externalID":"s:12GnustoEngine11CombatStateV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GnustoEngine"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CombatState"}],"title":"CombatState","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatState","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"generated":